ent-RUMCSharpStake = sharpened stake
    .desc = A stake with its end sharpened and fire-hardened. A palisade is made of them.
ent-RUMCSpikes = spikes
    .desc = Steel spikes set on the floor close together with their points up. Whoever falls onto them is run through, and the higher the fall the worse.
ent-RUMCPalisade = palisade
    .desc = A wall of sharpened stakes set close together and lashed with planks. Nothing gets through it without cutting or burning it.

au14-craft-recipe-stake-branch = Sharpened stake (from a branch)
au14-craft-recipe-stakes-plank = Sharpened stakes (three from a plank)

au14-fall-spikes-impaled = You fall onto the spikes and they run you through!
